  - eigenvalue geometry
abstract: >-
  Code, machine-readable results, robustness analyses, and manuscript sources
  for a descriptive study of fitted first-order vector autoregressive operators
  across human intracranial electroencephalography and scalp electroencephalography
  datasets. The repository evaluates spectral radius, minimum eigenvalue spacing,
  eigenvector conditioning, and related geometry summaries across band, anesthesia,
  and sleep-state contrasts. All results are conditional on the declared estimator
  and preprocessing pipeline and are not interpreted as identification of underlying
  neural mechanisms.
